{
  "tema": 5159,
  "slug": "futuro-hacer",
  "titulo": "Conjugate hacer in the simple future",
  "subtitulo": "Hacer shrinks to har-: haré, harás, haremos. No c, no e.",
  "foto": "t08.jpg",
  "regla": "Hacer uses the irregular stem har-, then adds -é, -ás, -á, -emos, -án.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": "2026-10-10",
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Hacer** (_to do, to make_) is irregular in the **simple future** (**futuro imperfecto**) because its stem is irregular: **har-**. The **c** and the **e** both disappear."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "formula",
          "partes": [
            "irregular stem **har-**",
            "**-é, -ás, -á, -emos, -án**"
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "tabla",
          "encabezados": [
            "Person",
            "Ending",
            "hacer → har-"
          ],
          "filas": [
            [
              "yo",
              "-é",
              "haré"
            ],
            [
              "tú",
              "-ás",
              "harás"
            ],
            [
              "él, ella, usted",
              "-á",
              "hará"
            ],
            [
              "nosotros",
              "-emos",
              "haremos"
            ],
            [
              "ustedes, ellos",
              "-án",
              "harán"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Verbs built on **hacer** do the same: **deshacer** → **desharé**, **rehacer** → **reharé**, **satisfacer** → **satisfaré**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: in the future you're too busy to say the whole word: **ha(ce)ré** → **haré**."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "==Haré== la carne asada el domingo.",
              "en": "I'll make the carne asada on Sunday."
            },
            {
              "es": "¿==Harás== lo que te dice el profe en el entrenamiento?",
              "en": "Will you do what the coach tells you in training?"
            },
            {
              "es": "Amos no ==hará== el trabajo de Holden.",
              "en": "Amos won't do Holden's job."
            },
            {
              "es": "Nosotros ==haremos== las tortillas.",
              "en": "We'll make the tortillas."
            },
            {
              "es": "Ustedes ==harán== muchos amigos en el agua.",
              "en": "You'll make lots of friends in the water."
            },
            {
              "es": "Mañana ==hará== calor en Rosarito.",
              "en": "It will be hot in Rosarito tomorrow."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "trampa",
      "titulo": "The trap",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "pares",
          "lista": [
            {
              "filas": [
                {
                  "v": "mal",
                  "t": "Haceré la tarea en la noche."
                },
                {
                  "v": "bien",
                  "t": "Haré la tarea en la noche."
                }
              ],
              "nota": "Never **haceré**: the stem is **har-**."
            },
            {
              "filas": [
                {
                  "v": "mal",
                  "t": "Mañana hara frío."
                },
                {
                  "v": "bien",
                  "t": "Mañana hará frío."
                }
              ],
              "nota": "**Hará** needs its accent. Without it, it reads like a different word."
            },
            {
              "filas": [
                {
                  "v": "mal",
                  "t": "Ya lo decidieron: ellos harían la cena."
                },
                {
                  "v": "bien",
                  "t": "Ya lo decidieron: ellos harán la cena."
                }
              ],
              "nota": "It's decided, so it's the future: **harán** (_will make_). **Harían** (_would make_) is the conditional."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "usos",
      "titulo": "Other verbs with a special stem",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "usos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "forma": "haré",
              "texto": "**hacer** → **har-**",
              "aqui": true
            },
            {
              "forma": "diré",
              "texto": "**decir** → **dir-**. See [[5161|decir in the future]]."
            },
            {
              "forma": "hará calor",
              "texto": "Weather with **hacer** works in the future too: **hará frío**, **hará sol**."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "parientes",
