              "texto": "The endings are the same as for every verb in the future: [[5155|regular verbs in the simple future]]."
            },
            {
              "forma": "hago → haré",
              "texto": "In the present only **yo** is irregular: [[5708|hacer in the present]]."
            },
            {
              "forma": "haría",
              "texto": "The conditional uses the very same stem, with **-ía** endings: [[5064|the conditional]]."
            },
            {
              "forma": "¿Dónde estará?",
              "texto": "The future also guesses about right now: [[5060|the future for probability]]."
            },
